For context, here's what I'm securing:

**Cluster:** 4-node Kubernetes (kubeadm)
- Master: 5.75.206.111 (Frankfurt)
- Worker1: 5.75.198.10 (Frankfurt)
- Worker2: 91.107.250.5 (Frankfurt)
- Worker3: 65.109.212.122 (Helsinki)

**Public Services:**
- goalixa.com (landing page)
- app.goalixa.com (PWA application)

**Private Services:**
- argocd.goalixa.com (GitOps)
- harbor.goalixa.com (Container registry)
- monitoring.goalixa.com (Grafana)

